# Batch files are run by cmd.exe, which wants CRLF, and they are only
# ever used on Windows. Everything else keeps LF whatever the checkout.
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# The H.264 and AAC test vectors, and the pictures and samples a reference
# decoder made from them. A newline translated anywhere in any of these is a
# decoder bug that only appears on one platform, so none of them is ever
# text.
*.264 binary
*.i420.z binary
*.mp4 binary
*.aac binary
*.f32.z binary
